/**
 * Public setting keys matching Go's IsPublicSetting() from internal/configdef/definition.go.
 * Non-admin users only receive these keys via /public/site-config and /settings/get-by-keys.
 *
 * Generated by extracting all IsPublic: true entries from Go definition.go,
 * then resolving constant.KeyXxx to actual string values from pkg/constant/setting.go.
 * Total: 233 public keys (matching Go backend exactly).
 *
 * SECURITY: Keys with IsPublic: false in Go definition.go must NOT appear here.
 * Private keys include: JWT_SECRET, SMTP credentials, CDN secrets, API tokens,
 * captcha secret keys, webhook config, pushoo config, queue/image-cache internals,
 * email templates, and other admin-only settings.
 */

